---
# PSY-Q SDK surface layer (src/psx)

InheritParentConfig: true

CheckOptions:
  - { key: readability-identifier-naming.FunctionCase, value: CamelCase }
  # psyq_* keeps the decompilation's renamed PSY-Q heap entry points greppable.
  - { key: readability-identifier-naming.FunctionIgnoredRegexp,
      value: '^func_[0-9A-Fa-f]+$|^psyq_[a-z0-9_]+$' }
...
